From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:04:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebrand as ReNova Player

New name, application id (io.github.oop23.renova), provider authorities,
dark launcher icon (adaptive + monochrome + legacy), TV banner and
status bar icon: a renewal arrow around a play button with a nova
spark. The FileProvider authority is derived from the package name and
the release updater points at the fork.
